      "settings": {
        "pf_ebee6728_value": "<b>Program Specifics:</b>\n<br>The Canadian Protein Subscription Program is available on select products across our website.Subscription orders already include subscription pricing where applicable. Some sales, promotions, and discount codes cannot be combined with subscription orders. To find out whether an active promotion applies to subscriptions, please review the FAQs at the bottom of the applicable sale landing page.<br><br><b>Eligibility:</b><br>The subscription program is available to customers shopping on canadianprotein.com. Availability of products, payment methods, shipping options, and support services may vary by region.<br><br><b>Pricing and Payment:</b><br>Subscription pricing is set by Canadian Protein and may change from time to time.Accepted payment methods may include major credit cards, debit cards, PayPal, Google Pay, and Shop Pay, depending on availability at checkout. By placing a subscription order, you authorize Canadian Protein to charge your selected payment method on a recurring basis according to your chosen subscription frequency, unless your subscription is skipped, paused, or canceled in accordance with these terms.If there is an issue with billing or payment, please contact our customer support team for assistance.<br><br><b>Changes and Cancellations:</b>\n<br>Customers can manage or cancel their subscriptions by logging into their subscription account and following the provided instructions. While there are no fees for canceling, a minimum of three orders is required before a subscription can be canceled.<br><br><b>Shipping and Returns:</b><br>Our shipping policy for the subscription program follows our standard shipping policy.<br><br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/terms-and-conditions\" target=\"_self\">Click here to view our shipping standard policy</a>&lt;&lt;<br><br>Returns of products received through the subscription program are subject to our standard return policy.<br><br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://support.canadianprotein.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500001289922-What-is-Canadian-Protein-s-Return-Policy-\" target=\"_self\">Click here to view out standard returns policy</a>&lt;&lt;<br><br><b>Data Privacy:</b><br>We are committed to protecting customer data in accordance with our Privacy Policy. By participating in the subscription program, customers agree to the collection, use, and processing of their personal data as outlined in the Privacy Policy.<br>\n<br>&gt;&gt;<a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/privacy-policy-1\" target=\"_self\"></a><a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/privacy-policy-1\" target=\"_self\">Click here to view our full Privacy policy</a>&lt;&lt;<br><br><b>Security:</b><br>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to help protect your personal information and payment data.While we take security seriously, no method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security. We employ security measures, including encryption and secure methods, to protect customer data. However, we cannot guarantee the absolute security of transmitted or stored information.\n<br><br><b>Disputes and Liability:</b><br>These Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Province of Ontario and the federal laws of Canada applicable therein.To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Canadian Protein shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or relating to the subscription program, including delays, product unavailability, pricing changes, or interruptions in service.Nothing in these Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions limits any rights that may apply under applicable consumer protection laws.\n<br><br><b>Changes to Terms:</b><br>Canadian Protein may update or modify these Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions from time to time.Any changes will take effect once posted to this page, unless otherwise stated. Your continued use of the subscription program after any updates are posted constitutes acceptance of those changes.\n\n",
        "pf_56e4f527_value": "<strong>ⓘ&nbsp; November 2025 | Price Increase Notice:</strong><br><br>Effective November 2025, the prices of select Canadian Protein Protein Products will be adjusted to reflect increased ingredient and production costs. Prices will increase by $10 for 1kg sizes and $20 for 2kg sizes. While this adjustment is necessary to maintain our commitment to premium ingredients and high manufacturing standards, Canadian Protein continues to offer some of the most competitively priced, high-quality protein products in the market. Our goal remains to provide exceptional value without compromising on quality, purity, or taste.<br><br>Locked-in subscription discounts (from previous promotions) will continue to be honoured; however, the base price of affected products will reflect the updated pricing. Customers with existing subscription discounts will still receive their agreed-upon percentage off, applied to the new base prices.<br><br>November 2025 price increase products include, but are not limited to:<br>- Economy Whey - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Whey Protein Concentrate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Premium Whey Protein Blend - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Whey Protein Isolate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Grass-Fed New Zealand  Whey Protein Concentrate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Grass-Fed New Zealand Whey Protein Isolate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Premium Whey Protein Isolate - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br>- Vegan Protein - 1kg &amp; 2kg<br><br>Updated: November 11th 2025.&nbsp;",
        "pf_22c7cc92_value": "You can visit the Return Center to process a return for a refund. (not applicable outside of Canada)\n\nReturn Page Policy:<br> <br><a href=\"https://canadianprotein.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500001289922-What-is-Canadian-Protein-s-Return-Policy- Return Center\" target=\"_blank\">https://canadianprotein.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/1500001289922-What-is-Canadian-Protein-s-Return-Policy- Return Center</a> \n\n<br><br><a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/returns\" target=\"_blank\">https://canadianprotein.com/pages/returns</a>",
        "pf_70891858_value": "Our subscription service is designed to make your life easier, ensuring you never run out of your favorite Canadian Protein supplements. With our service, you can enjoy regular, hassle-free deliveries right to your doorstep. So, whether you're new to Canadian Protein or a loyal customer, read on to discover how our Subscription Program can benefit you and answer all your questions. Remember, we're committed to your fitness journey and here to help you every step of the way! ",
        "pf_52001d7e_value": "Yes — your locked-in subscription discount will continue to apply to your orders. However, the base price of affected products has increased due to rising ingredient and production costs.&nbsp;For example, if your subscription includes a 5% locked-in discount, that discount will still be applied to your orders, but it will be calculated based on the new product pricing.",
        "pf_804e41ec_value": "Yes. You will keep the subscription discount you locked in, based on the terms of the promotion you joined.&nbsp;Some promotions offer discounts that never expire, while others are valid only for a set time period. Please note:&nbsp;Even when your discount remains active, product prices may increase over time, and your discount will apply to the updated product price.",
        "pf_379eb98a_value": "Welcome to the Canadian Protein Subscription Program. These Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions explain how our subscription service works, including billing, pricing, order management, shipping, returns, and other important details.By purchasing a subscription product from Canadian Protein, you agree to these Subscription Terms &amp; Conditions.",
        "pf_233299ed_value": "As a proudly Canadian company, we’ve worked hard to keep our prices fair without compromising on quality or safety. However, rising costs across raw whey protein, ingredients, and production have made a modest subscription price adjustment necessary so we can continue delivering the products and service you expect.",
        "pf_b9f08c70_value": "Welcome to our Subscription Program! We understand that you may have several questions about this service. That's why we've put together this comprehensive FAQ section to provide you with all the essential information you need. ",
        "pf_7f7e6fa1_value": "Some promotions and discount codes cannot be combined with subscription orders. To check whether a current sale applies to subscriptions, please scroll to the bottom of the main sale landing page and review the FAQs.",
        "pf_4e5cfbba_value": "You must have an activated Canadian Protein account to have full access to your subscription. Once the Canadian Protein account is activated you can visit My Account &gt; Manage Subscription.",
        "pf_87cc5db6_value": "Unfortunately you are not able to pay a subscription with Sezzle.<a href=\"https://canadianprotein.com/pages/returns\" target=\"_blank\"></a>",
        "pf_c5598e4d_value": "You can swap this product or you sign up for the restock alert, select your Next Order date to re-activate your subscription.",
        "pf_18b73ba0_label": "I have a locked-in subscription discount from a previous promotion. Will this still apply with the price increase?",
        "pf_4ea61b85_value": "Subscriptions can not be accessed through a mobile device, all edits are to be made with a computer.",
        "pf_99ed486c_label": "Can I alter the flavours/sizes of the protein that I order for recurring orders?",
